{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_41_1689932687#6_2616445571","relevance":2,"reason":"The document is mainly about preventing compassion fatigue rather than being dedicated to vicarious trauma, but it directly mentions vicarious trauma and gives relevant coping/prevention strategies such as self-care, emotional boundaries, hobbies, friendships, journaling, resiliency, positive coping, workplace strategies, and personal therapy.","learned":"Relevant coping strategies include education, self-care, emotional boundaries, outside hobbies, healthy friendships outside work, journaling, resilience-building, positive coping, workplace strategies, and personal therapy."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"vicarious trauma\" \"signs and symptoms\" (+ \"how to cope\" coping \"self-care\" strategies))","reason":"Search for pages explicitly focused on vicarious trauma signs/symptoms plus coping or self-care, which should retrieve dedicated answer documents rather than broader compassion-fatigue articles."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"vicarious trauma\" \"signs and symptoms\" (+ \"how to cope\" coping \"self-care\" strategies))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_13_1647729865#5_3617406818","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q1024","rank":5,"snippet":"{ \"docid\": \"msmarco_v2.1_doc_13_1647729865#5_3617406818\" , \"end_char\": 3757.000000 , \"headings\": \"Vicarious Trauma: When Empathy Goes Too Far & How to Cope with it Vicarious Trauma: When Empathy Goes Too Far & <cover>How to Cope with it What is Vicarious Trauma & Who is Susceptible to it? Signs and Symptoms </cover>of Vicarious Trauma How to Treat Vicarious Trauma Methods To Treat Vicarious Trauma Trauma-Focused Cognitive Behavioural Therapy (TF-CBT): Eye Movement Desensitization and Reprocessing (EMDR): Get Professional Help \" , \"segment\": \"headaches, stomach pain, exhaustion (among other physical symptoms) Behavioural: isolating or disconnecting from others, alcohol or substance abuse, experiencing a change in eating habits, engaging in risky behaviour, having difficulty sleeping and procrastinating. You may also find yourself struggling with concentration, decision making, and memory In this, Ted Talk where trauma worker Amy Cunningham talks about ways vicarious trauma can manifest negatively in our lives. She also reminds us to put ourselves first. How to Treat Vicarious Trauma The first stride towards treating Vicarious Trauma is taking a step back and getting yourself out of the trauma ","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_13_1647729865#0_3617397938","rank":1,"relevance":3},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_13_1647729865#1_3617399591","rank":2,"relevance":3},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_39_158990471#10_315227890","rank":3,"relevance":2},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_39_158990471#9_315225168","rank":4,"relevance":2}]}}
